creatures:
- name: Storm Giant
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 16  
      **Hit Points** 230 (rollable(dice=20d12 + 100,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 50 ft., Fly 25 ft. (hover), Swim 50 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Initiative) (17)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=29)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+14,label=+14,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Arcana rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Arcana Check), Athletics rollable(dice=1d20+14,label=+14,dicelabel=Athletics Check), History rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=History Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold  
      **Damage Immunities** lightning, thunder  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., truesight 30 ft., Passive Perception 20  
      **Languages** Common, Giant  
      **Challenge** 13 (10,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +5  

      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The giant can breathe air and water.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The giant makes two attacks, using Storm Sword or Thunderbolt in any combination.

      ***Storm Sword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+14,label=+14,dicelabel=To Hit [Storm Sword]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d6+9,dicelabel=Damage [Storm Sword]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=3d8,dicelabel=Damage [Storm Sword]) Lightning damage.

      ***Thunderbolt.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+14,label=+14,dicelabel=To Hit [Thunderbolt]), range 500 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d12+9,dicelabel=Damage [Thunderbolt]) Lightning damage, and the target has the ***Blinded*** and ***Deafened*** conditions until the start of the giant's next turn.

      ***Lightning Storm (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Lightning Storm])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 18, each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high ***Cylinder*** originating from a point the giant can see within 500 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=10d10,dicelabel=Damage [Lightning Storm]) Lightning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The giant casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 18):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Light](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618996-light)  
      1/day: [Control Weather](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619054-control-weather)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Giant, Chaotic Good*  
    **Challenge** 13
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024stormgiant
  status: 1

